{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_title", "source_sha256": "24c207764a1d310aeae7c951ef3c0a44baa36cec08536b264e188ee02b2ef256", "ja": "くもり、ときどき、みんな晴れ", "zh": "阴天，偶有，大家晴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e84d5424f6c413b6228b24638ea063dc464ab57bc677d148fcd93a94360ddb09", "ja": "環と共に劇場の定期公演を見学しに来る育。\n紛失した朋花の衣装ボタンを買いにおつかい\nに出るも、帰りのバスを寝過ごしてしまう。\n失敗に落ち込む気持ちを、仲間の励ましで\n切り替え、育は自身の公演を成功させる。", "zh": "育和环一起来到剧场参观定期公演。\n她出门跑腿去买朋花弄丢的服装纽扣，\n却在回程的公交车上睡过了站。\n虽然因为失误而感到失落，但在同伴的鼓励下，\n育调整好心态，让属于自己的公演大获成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e988f418249ab94fa3c8ab272ed13baeec3407b75530bb6261a29464c8f4dbc", "ja": "（公演の準備を進めるが、育と環の様子が気にかかる。\nちゃんと買い物できてるといいけど……）", "zh": "（虽然在推进公演的准备工作，但还是很在意育和环的情况。希望她们能顺利买到东西……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "2f7d0030d797dc35f617bd261874b487e0f271bc990d4154d46a87c0a78e3401", "ja": "{$P$}。\n3曲目のつなぎって、結局どうなったか覚えてる？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n你还记得第3首歌的衔接最后是怎么安排的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4a75bad45892ff2bbee7ec7d5bad65de680fed10869c7ebd32a715c59880ea5c", "ja": "え？　あ、ええと……MCがカットになりました。\nなので、2曲目の終わりは……あれ？", "zh": "咦？啊，这个……MC被删掉了。\n所以第2首歌结束时……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "bb8ec473dac3de67760aa76cd9525fb9a96fba2fa206acb81a7d80cc3fb17a6e", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃん？\nさっきから、打ち合わせに集中できてないよ。", "zh": "真是的，大哥哥？\n你从刚才开始就一直没集中精神开会哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "248d9b4eed7bf16af85157f170aebcc7ab213a911001b7dd8d5431edc9411df9", "ja": "ちゃんと集中して！\n公演中にミスが起きたら、そっちのほうが大変でしょ。", "zh": "好好集中！\n要是在演出中出了差错，那才更麻烦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "0700011fe60673e742d2ab7c69126112badd028d1b998cbf8a881a3736f1a882", "ja": "ふたりが心配なのは、わかるわ。\nでもそれは、私たちも同じだから……。", "zh": "我明白你是在担心他们两个。\n不过，我们也一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "81209220c31a7baef4126db04cd7e5e4bf4abd8187e465f78ef542a89fe4f26b", "ja": "そうですね～。{$P$}さんには、\n今やるべきお仕事に専念してもらわないと～。", "zh": "是啊～。必须让{$P$}先生专心做好现在该做的工作才行～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "1832335bfbea14765fa4e622fbb62e0ecc3840c7603658d8d94628b058bfd930", "ja": "そうでなければ、育ちゃんと環ちゃんの気遣いが、\n無駄になってしまいますよ～？", "zh": "不然的话，育和环的这份心意就要白费了哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d9c32d4ac82c867671dbcc708a5a5da5359e6f1d4fbf1950c27330644110f381", "ja": "そうだな。せっかく、育と環が買い物を引き受けて\nくれたんだ。公演の準備に集中しないとな！", "zh": "是啊。难得育和环主动帮忙买东西，我得集中精力准备公演才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1009_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c67d3c8d38742642c1e086c7e476281a3720b2e88d9389d969de25b3994ac869", "ja": "噂をすれば……育から電話だ。\nもしもし、育？　環は？　ふたりとも、無事か？", "zh": "说曹操曹操到……是育打来的电话。\n喂，育？环呢？你们两个都平安无事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "8a916825e8f1908ccfc6883d33c04532c2db5ce587c99600d4d576a5ddfe55c6", "ja": "おつかれさま、{$P$}さん。\nもう、そんなに心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n真是的，不用那么担心也没关系啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "4c2ec3257647b139fb2b16ebc008a44e198f8bf11c42220bf6c182490e102909", "ja": "あのね、美咲さんが探してたボタン、\nちゃんと買えたよ！　だから、これから帰るね！", "zh": "那个，美咲姐姐在找的纽扣，我顺利买到了哦！所以，我这就回去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1013_p", "source_sha256": "93d6f5739a42ca764c91cb4070025656b8136ccc03f5a09ce144825ef9115071", "ja": "そうか、買えたか！　ありがとう。\n帰り道も気をつけてな！", "zh": "这样啊，买到了啊！谢谢你。\n回去路上也要小心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "377a29dae177f5f2575eef0f87b4124ea6561fcf52736acdcc6911664530d5aa", "ja": "うん！　それじゃね！", "zh": "嗯！那再见啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ca129739f0355240b09966c94802bcc02ec8980b32942e63bf45306e4bef6df4", "ja": "（無事に買い物できたみたいでよかった。\nこれなら、公演にも間に合いそうだな！）", "zh": "（看来顺利买到东西了，太好了。这样一来，应该就能赶上公演了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "2c492c9d094ee9973988a66f8b0bbcfead1374fb19aa01cf42fd1d9171db790c", "ja": "{$P$}さんにほうこく、終わり！\n帰ろう、環ちゃん♪", "zh": "跟{$P$}先生报告完毕！\n我们回去吧，环♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "e188e733c3d331bc0af4ad08602d24b0bf628a17fa236aaaa3b4c8a161d510b1", "ja": "うん！　たまきたち、カンペキにおつかいできたぞ～。\nともか、ごほうびくれるかな？　くふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！环和大家把跑腿任务完美完成啦～。\n朋花会给奖励吗？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "22f31357308d6c19b7878be616fd19678c9ef204588f7c77746a168634873086", "ja": "ね、心配いらなかったでしょ？　わたし、\nおかあさんと何度も来たことがあるんだから♪", "zh": "你看，没什么好担心的吧？我以前和妈妈来过这里好多次呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "97cdf431919b5b5170406797940ac2e73b4071e92e552c6cc27258c0c5bbd7a7", "ja": "そうだ……環ちゃん！　劇場までバスで帰ろうよ！", "zh": "对了……环！我们坐公交车回剧场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "8512875b6f17b7c2340e17d99307706a0d3ec22bd640473b49eccfb2018e6692", "ja": "バス？\nいいけど……電車じゃなくて大丈夫？", "zh": "公交车？\n可以是可以……不坐电车真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "69586a5307f53fc5918772949aa9be0b4f34c9110fa087936ce229385ddc0331", "ja": "おかあさんと来ると、帰りはいつもバスなんだ。\nそれに、バスの方が電車より早くつけるんだよ！", "zh": "和妈妈一起来的话，回去时总是坐公交车的。\n而且，坐公交车比坐电车更快到呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "df12a04acc268d355dad809f4e55a599c19f0f436bfd1d7410a14c5ae6b74e65", "ja": "そっか。それなら、バスで帰ろう！\nみさきに、早くボタン届けてあげたいもんね！", "zh": "这样啊。那我们就坐公交车回去吧！\n毕竟想早点把按钮送到美咲手上嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "b559a6694b9e91653a24ec8c67362fd6c025b1434f92d7c2281187c831d586a9", "ja": "うん！　バス乗り場は……あっち！\n環ちゃん、行こう♪", "zh": "嗯！公交车站……在那边！小环，我们走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1024_null", "source_sha256": "1b15106fd9633e269f9a850410c6a213bc2a197732bf86478df08459fd0d3e12", "ja": "ブロロロロロロ……", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1025_p", "source_sha256": "50382efdded8914e1ea1b9c3bec5e77134645aa1e1294e69cdf2a2bc892ff94b", "ja": "（育の電話がきてから、だいぶ時間が過ぎた。しかし、\nふたりが劇場に戻ってくる気配はまだない……）", "zh": "（育打来电话后，已经过去了相当长一段时间。然而，还是没有两人要回到剧场的迹象……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "852952283fd91bdf8d5c7c4f6fdfb612ab77bcff76ccea45389fe5652ec2150c", "ja": "{$P$}、リハーサル終わったわよ。\n育ちゃんと環ちゃんは……まだ戻ってないみたいね。", "zh": "{$P$}，彩排结束了。小育和小环……好像还没回来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c25cf88799708b2e65e550da8902be4cc563ea3c47b6b853c9e61e1a919a1586", "ja": "あっ、このみさん。リハーサル、\n後半立ち会えなくて、すみませんでした。", "zh": "啊，这个美小姐。排练的后半段没能到场，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "c989b5d1fe813d1d1334e151724e5e0b03c889d1bb01cce39ac77495f31dbb97", "ja": "いいのよ。ふたりが戻ってきた時、\n{$P$}がいたほうが安心でしょ。", "zh": "没事的啦。她们两个回来的时候，\n有{$P$}在也比较安心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "62c40d5024ab1cac85c555ae1ac81246f7911286d6871cc0445b7f173663a58f", "ja": "ね、ねえ、お兄ちゃん。\nその……なんでもない……。", "zh": "那、那个……哥哥。\n没什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d86ab8c3d8511e6bab4d181e1eea45994886cc68be8fa46626cdbecb4e8b5509", "ja": "（しまった……公演前のみんなを不安にさせるのは\n良くないな。ここはふたりに連絡して、居場所を……）", "zh": "（糟了……不该让大家在演出前感到不安。还是联系两人，确认一下她们在哪里吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1032_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f7081448bc28cb2523139fdd6cc92ff63b9fafcdeffb46965a62e3801dc29f6e", "ja": "！！　もしもし、育！　大丈夫か？", "zh": "！！喂喂，育！没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "8c00b7df58ab655ba03e9f79dfd47e27de370bfe786d3ddc0d5d928f19f5bd60", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nううっ、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n呜呜，对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "54d8a28f0a785ef76984e0de33a330015fec815aeb4a97ab33671b4416db1f65", "ja": "わたしたち、帰りはバスに乗ってたんだけど……\n気づいたらとちゅうで寝ちゃって……。", "zh": "我们回来的时候是坐公交车的……\n回过神来，才发现自己在半路睡着了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "3ba246d1f0b0cf0b1b4b4b1a5277843add28db6355d25ffccb55fcdb7f9ca176", "ja": "目が覚めたら、知らないところに来ちゃってたの……\n本当にごめんなさい……。", "zh": "醒来后，才发现自己来到了一个陌生的地方……\n真的很对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1037_p", "source_sha256": "4b8bd14e50335a86393da77ef2e6b88d6ca024d295e37e8f687a62596bbd7718", "ja": "そうだったのか……事故や誘拐じゃなくてよかった。\n迎えに行くから、バス停の名前を教えてくれるか？", "zh": "原来是这样……不是遇到事故或被绑架，真是太好了。\n我去接你，能告诉我公交车站的名字吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1038_030iku", "source_sha256": "7f82127190aa0773a87dca1efc870298dc645000254cedaa8b60d252fdafd1d5", "ja": "えっ！？　わたしたちなら、へ、平気だよ！\nボタンは、間に合わなくなっちゃったけど……。", "zh": "诶！？我们的话，没、没关系的！\n按钮虽然没能赶上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "47a8d2f5c9a11106216bf90724dcf099a4e97e1f91b02370070975be5a85eff4", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nおしごとがあるんだから、そっちをやって！", "zh": "{$P$}先生还有工作要忙，\n去忙那个啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1040_p", "source_sha256": "56d6fbb8e552fe237ffa2360537be6852db0eb70da7821eb385efaa5c8151836", "ja": "育の気持ちはわかるけど、\nそれで、また迷ったらどうするんだ？", "zh": "我明白育的心情，可要是这样又迷茫了，该怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "05bfffdbc449413495bae8907769e15eaccd405ab0e45cc88c82fd3d0ebecff2", "ja": "で、でも、わたし……\nみんなに、めいわくかけたくないもん！", "zh": "可、可是，我……\n我不想给大家添麻烦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1042_p", "source_sha256": "f37d60603f62ed78d837b828d3d00754e696256f2f4556884f62fa9aea02519d", "ja": "育……。", "zh": "育……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "10df0c897b5c7a685c23d7a02e2c22472d59be580c67d815cc17eb05a9911bab", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\n少しだけ、育ちゃんとお話してもいいですか～？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。\n可以让我稍微和育妹妹说两句吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1044_p", "source_sha256": "379de2dbfa31ce313539814c05f47826ededc6c370e88a4e9a99a787820550e0", "ja": "朋花……。\n育、ちょっと待ってくれ。朋花に替わるな。", "zh": "朋花……\n育，等一下。我来跟朋花说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1045_030iku", "source_sha256": "b23b9fdb7e2db0633539c8fbcb96cc4a4766184ee9bc3ec370de187868a85ef2", "ja": "えっ？　と、朋花さん？", "zh": "诶？朋、朋花姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1046_031tom", "source_sha256": "bbb1692c8b729e48f0e2c0c74f0e56a73c04ce865c4e1b5826338c57ff5585b9", "ja": "育ちゃん。環ちゃんと一緒に、よくがんばりましたね。\n私のために力を尽くしてくれたこと、感謝しますよ～。", "zh": "小育。和小环一起努力了呢。感谢你们为了我竭尽全力～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1047_030iku", "source_sha256": "738b08c7cbe90a9758ae9dbece8a68294d55b2887ce363323984fd063ec4dd25", "ja": "朋花さん……ううん。\nわたし、役に立てなかったね……。", "zh": "朋花……不对。\n我……没能帮上什么忙……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "56d5580630c80abeffaf0016d53800b09793c586ee2f7c14d04572a33c06ea06", "ja": "謝らなくていいんですよ～。たとえ衣装のボタンが\n足りなくても、聖母が届ける慈愛は変わりません～。", "zh": "不用道歉哦～。即使衣服上少了一颗纽扣，\n圣母传递的慈爱也不会改变哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1049_031tom", "source_sha256": "c99c8ea3edd7effd08f37e43325643416039037067039ddaa5e57e40e531526f", "ja": "それに、育ちゃんと環ちゃんの優しい気持ちは、\n巡り巡って、子豚ちゃんたちにも伝わるはずです～。", "zh": "而且，育和环的温柔心意，\n兜兜转转，一定也会传达给小猪偶们的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1050_031tom", "source_sha256": "539907022c355e02b958b96dd62b8a6abc94dcdc458f162e462e86eb3da49949", "ja": "ですから、ふたりとも～。次は、私たちを\n安心させるために、無事に帰ってきてくださいね～。", "zh": "所以，你们两个～下次请平安回来，让我们放心哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1051_030iku", "source_sha256": "ca4f5fa5428f566037e8ace277a8c7690fd17a2587771881eac562f4eed92dfd", "ja": "朋花さん……。うん、わかった！　えっと、\n{$P$}さんに替わってくれる……？", "zh": "朋花……嗯，知道了！那个，\n能帮我换到{$P$}先生那边……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1053_p", "source_sha256": "81b68f9773e753d6638c8b0f440d4d35165a14019831af2b50c5415d55d53739", "ja": "ただいま。\n公演は……無事に終わったみたいだな。", "zh": "我回来了。\n公演……看来顺利结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1056_039kon", "source_sha256": "2d4e34d3549bf95aaef5a14adfc0da659811ae6c279a148c94e38a34a84dc753", "ja": "おかえりなさい、育ちゃん、環ちゃん！\n{$P$}も、お疲れさま！", "zh": "欢迎回来，育、环！\n{$P$}也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1057_049mom", "source_sha256": "809b692d5e6cf19e0030fa22d2a0497a51b4b8dc6b00dc2b8f9bfe7bcd52d532", "ja": "あっ……育、環。\n帰ってきたんだね、よかった……。", "zh": "啊……育、环。\n你们回来了啊，太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1058_030iku", "source_sha256": "bde3fadbe961491189d2fd0e38228d8dbc4495d846f9c72df695a7763276e453", "ja": "みんな、ごめんなさい。\nまかせてって言ったのに、おつかいできなかった……。", "zh": "大家，对不起。\n明明说了包在我身上，却没能把东西买回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1059_040tam", "source_sha256": "c03d37fb19057e88111e560ba156018d87def041271ce6fe7a573a1e531f1c8f", "ja": "たまきも一緒にいたのに……。\nほんとに、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "明明环也一起去了……真的，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1060_031tom", "source_sha256": "a08ce3531117b9406c831d6590100bf43056a50254bf68b6245514a33565c501", "ja": "育ちゃん、環ちゃん、無事でよかったです。\nふたりとも、よくがんばりましたね～。", "zh": "小育、小环，平安无事真是太好了。你们两个都很努力呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1061_030iku", "source_sha256": "6ee7a3570f1f598838c0ad277b5a53619d5dc3059571fd5842cea732849121f6", "ja": "朋花さん……。", "zh": "朋花姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1062_031tom", "source_sha256": "91aceeeb12cc83f6ddb807e8431ecf5511ae2c16bc516b323a296d5b54158f45", "ja": "ふたりは、私のためにおつかいに行ってくれたんです。\nそのことを、後悔してはいけませんよ～？", "zh": "她们两位可是为了我去跑腿的。\n你们可不能为这件事后悔哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1063_039kon", "source_sha256": "3922afcfea5180a46d6b63299a001ee8f4d7dbb5b41a2ea7c9516a583226fdb4", "ja": "そうね。失敗なんて、誰にでもあるものよ。それに、\n私もよくやるのよね……バスや電車の乗り過ごし。", "zh": "是啊。谁都有失败的时候。而且，我也经常会坐过站……不管是公交车还是电车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1064_030iku", "source_sha256": "6d945b2f6de68a07eb1205beff9706fdccff3bf424f1832467a53bb19fd33a95", "ja": "このみさんも？\n大人でも、乗り過ごしちゃうことがあるの？", "zh": "木实姐也会吗？\n大人也会有坐过站的时候吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1065_039kon", "source_sha256": "46f16a27d8f7f5dc8d39c7e6b502931ad729725ffcaea9fc82f5673dfefa8669", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。だから困った時は、周りの人に\n頼っていいの。そうよね、{$P$}？", "zh": "是啊，就是这样。所以遇到困难时，也可以依靠身边的人。对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1066_p", "source_sha256": "d9064290bdef2b6bd77fd7937a5576a750f0073c95ac1bf4a0d779d72ff62a21", "ja": "そうですね。\nアイドルの力になるのが、プロデューサーですから。", "zh": "没错。\n制作人的职责，就是成为偶像的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1067_049mom", "source_sha256": "9dc0821ee9b5114f904a396d95a77cf77c24db125f19a6edb9e18ed2b2c15d07", "ja": "このみさんとお兄ちゃんの言うとおりだよ。\nみんなに心配かける前に、助けてもらうこと！", "zh": "就像木实姐姐和哥哥说的那样。\n在让大家担心之前，就要寻求帮助！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1068_049mom", "source_sha256": "5c115fd8022d224861a80e58384c958e1345082c1cc5b0e670d4cb38fd129cc5", "ja": "もう……育も環も、帰ってくるの遅いよ。\n公演、終わっちゃったじゃない……。", "zh": "真是的……育和环回来得太慢了啦。\n演出不是都已经结束了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1069_039kon", "source_sha256": "a728d14bcdbeec56631a59616505ac3b407a56e116b5da39aa82bb5f66d44e03", "ja": "そうよね。桃子ちゃん、今日はふたりが\n観てくれるからって、すごく張り切ってたもんね。", "zh": "对啊。桃子今天想着两个人会来看，特别起劲来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1070_049mom", "source_sha256": "342f0c8530bcf5ba0601e10880af3a5f582c70c25eeb5f134067939f4313dbda", "ja": "そ、そんなことないけど！\nこのみさん、ヘンなこと言わないで！", "zh": "才、才不是那回事！\n木实姐，你别说奇怪的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1071_031tom", "source_sha256": "998dc7e5b2e65ff10f625e21db8a3d57eea044278fb15263b72d811fbd1cb5bd", "ja": "私も、ふたりに公演を見てもらえなくて残念です。\n育ちゃんには、ひとつ貸しができましたね～？", "zh": "我也很遗憾没能让你们两位看到演出。  \n小育欠我一个人情了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_064_1072_030iku", "source_sha256": "2d069103449f87e4d5eb0992c40b6560abe1a1ed24928eb21dbd85e2fed51cd8", "ja": "貸しって……ええと、何か返さなくちゃいけないよね？\nでも、どうやって返せばいいの？", "zh": "欠人情什么的……呃，也就是说，我得还点什么吧？可是，要怎么还呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
